                "content": "\"The study phase involves recalling a previously learned word pair. The task requires you to recall the first word of each pair and rate your confidence in remembering it. You will be given 50 words pairs, and you must remember them all. After studying these words, you are given the first word of each pair. Your job is to recall the second word and rate your confidence on a scale from 1 (very uncertain) to 5 (very confident). The goal is to provide honest responses based on what you learned.\"",
