                    {
                        "content": "\"The study phase involves recalling a word pair from memory. The task requires you to recall the first word of each pair and rate your confidence in remembering it. You will be given 50 words pairs, and you must remember them all. After studying the pairs, you are given the first word of each pair. Your job is to recall the second word and rate your confidence on a scale from 1 (not sure) to 5 (very confident). Remember that semantically unrelated words can be tricky.\"",
